ext":"¿Quiénes son sus familiares y tiene contacto?","guid":"gVv4_fR2RTaa239UBtkGZA","children":[]},{"id":"175","parent":"172","text":"¿A quién acudiría si tiene una urgencia?","guid":"b-ys27KLQlmDALRNZT_A4g","children":[]}]},{"id":"176","parent":"166","text":"Estrategias\\Nconcretas","guid":"jYXz1mb9TvyNYJd5DN0EgA","children":[{"id":"177","parent":"176","text":"Talleres comunitarios (CESFAM, municipalidad)","guid":"madbTJ0USv6liQFh_vsTDQ","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"176","text":"Mediación familiar","guid":"rZ4W4NShT66p-RyLRGLIhQ","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"176","text":"Centros de día","guid":"7LK0xfrVRruEaMS56MfW9w","children":[]},{"id":"180","parent":"176","text":"Voluntariado","guid":"OyyXrr1QTFOFTjtrf5Ukqg","children":[]},{"id":"181","parent":"176","text":"Actividades intergeneracionales","guid":"C3yn7YbcTCCMxMAHqB2WdQ","children":[]},{"id":"182","parent":"176","text":"Asistente social","guid":"NjAph6t4RjuXW2A6rGghyQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"183","parent":"0","text":"Pilar 6 —\\NEvitar\\Nsustancias\\Ntóxicas","guid":"3JQFqb4zRauJZ6fOqY-kzA","children":[{"id":"184","parent":"183","text":"Sustancias\\Nclásicas","guid":"e_SPEGJPTDWXcOvVk_UsxQ","children":[{"id":"185","parent":"184","text":"Tabaco","guid":"XQ8a-1W9Sdau93OPWCWOdA","children":[]},{"id":"186","parent":"184","text":"Alcohol","guid":"7cx3AqSaQhmy4Z8spmB2mw","children":[]},{"id":"187","parent":"184","text":"Otras drogas","guid":"Y-9Ft89YSoKWUsFh5hJnVQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"188","parent":"183","text":"Fármacos como\\Ntóxicos en geriatría","guid":"XInqmCALSla17px0K6ox1w","children":[{"id":"189","parent":"188","text":"Benzodiazepinas / hipnóticos Z","guid":"2knWjfTARembKZ1zeu7G5Q","children":[]},{"id":"190","parent":"188","text":"Hipnóticos no benzodiazepínicos","guid":"4zKLdpDWSeSWbU7K2dF0rg","children":[]},{"id":"191","parent":"188","text":"Opioides (atención con tramadol)","guid":"IV4_pC2aQ4K2MDuRUb0mjg","children":[]},{"id":"192","parent":"188","text":"Beers 2023 → revisar listado completo de PIMs","guid":"3NRSS1xpSISyEHvXm2FRFQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"193","parent":"183","text":"Modelo 5A\\N(MINSAL Chile +\\NOMS)","guid":"R3F3EQe6REK4VJIg5myAgA","children":[{"id":"194","parent":"193","text":"Averiguar → preguntar consumo","guid":"3_NcfdgtQT2k4k3X5otJcw","children":[]},{"id":"195","parent":"193","text":"Aconsejar → consejo individualizado","guid":"biy4A06DQH-z8riGW_dEvA","children":[]},{"id":"196","parent":"193","text":"Apreciar → disposición al cambio","guid":"mlWK4vmBTIOpLv4qOrLHcA","children":[]},{"id":"197","parent":"193","text":"Ayudar → entrevista motivacional + fármacos","guid":"sFbokoXVSO2ZXxd4JEGMRQ","children":[]},{"id":"198","parent":"193","text":"Acordar seguimiento","guid":"DGVe3P_0TcekYZLS7Lv4og","children":[]}]},{"id":"199","parent":"183","text":"Personalización\\Ndel consejo","guid":"GkYlX9deRB-NqzKo16oXuA","children":[{"id":"200","parent":"199","text":"Vincular daño con preocupación del paciente","guid":"vKhtzvcqR82NgdHMnETR-w","children":[]},{"id":"201","parent":"199","text":"Memoria / energía / dormir → más efectivo que genérico","guid":"yYAPyxvWT76kyxIp6IlJzg","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"202","parent":"0","text":"Implementación\\Nen la consulta","guid":"ojnhnyeBS8eEEBbDF0gqfQ","children":[{"id":"203","parent":"202","text":"Pasos","guid":"N09w5a-7Ro60uJvv1PCqWQ","children":[{"id":"204","parent":"203","text":"1. Identificar prioridades del paciente","guid":"iP9ohhm1QZKZyMroKCt8XQ","children":[]},{"id":"205","parent":"203","text":"2. Elegir UN solo hábito","guid":"kXRNfhDZSnioRZwG9fhM7g","children":[]},{"id":"206","parent":"203","text":"3. Entrevista motivacional","guid":"jSIkmI9kSLOfABbvtYXu3Q","children":[]},{"id":"207","parent":"203","text":"4. Objetivos SMART","guid":"IylFl-s0REqDo_mVUTIrkg","children":[]},{"id":"208","parent":"203","text":"5. Grado de confianza ≥70-80%","guid":"GSLS2L2lT4e-WA2gQQau_g","children":[]},{"id":"209","parent":"203","text":"6. Seguimiento 2-3 sem (correo) o 1 mes (consulta)","guid":"MGf6K-3SSpe6oz5HmcBKww","children":[]}]},{"id":"210","parent":"202","text":"Objetivos\\NSMART","guid":"hxNvZAdVR7-VMuTcBk2TPA","children":[{"id":"211","parent":"210","text":"S → Specific","guid":"hq78GhumSgGVedUDU2SOfg","children":[]},{"id":"212","parent":"210","text":"M → Measurable","guid":"MEO72-GXSgOLngAh_tYKqQ","children":[]},{"id":"213","parent":"210","text":"A → Achievable","guid":"AfszR1kuSaufleFfjKD-Dg","children":[]},{"id":"214","parent":"210","text":"R → Relevant para el paciente","guid":"VtzsuUkxRXyC4t3G11PFhg","children":[]},{"id":"215","parent":"210","text":"T → Time-bound (~1 mes)","guid":"U1uT4Z-vQKu43bKwOvRdtA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"216","parent":"0","text":"Preguntas Autoestudio (oficiales\\NDr. Juan Carlos Rodríguez)","guid":"Oi145_0tSRqA7td8-sVQCg","children":[{"id":"217","parent":"216","text":"1. ¿Cómo influye la sarcopenia en el desarrollo de fragilidad en personas mayores y de qué manera las intervenciones en estilo de vida pueden modificar su curso?","guid":"6eumDb-XSvWcx2iWEee59w","children":[]},{"id":"218","parent":"216","text":"2. Explique por qué el entrenamiento de fuerza debe considerarse una intervención terapéutica central en geriatría y describa cómo lo prescribiría en una consulta ambulatoria","guid":"8ozuQsniRG-TxQzXeHoLwQ","children":[]},{"id":"219","parent":"216","text":"3. Analice el rol de la ingesta proteica en la preservación de la masa muscular en personas mayores e indique recomendaciones prácticas que puedan aplicarse en la consulta clínica","guid":"TJhsRYl4QBiOx9i3A0LrGg","children":[]},{"id":"220","parent":"216","text":"4. Describa la relación entre sueño, inflamación crónica y deterioro funcional en el envejecimiento, y proponga intervenciones breves que puedan implementarse en atención primaria","guid":"teczYFzjQOK3MT998Qr7ZA","children":[]},{"id":"221","parent":"216","text":"5. Explique cómo la soledad y el aislamiento social impactan la salud física y mental en personas mayores, y mencione estrategias concretas para abordarlos desde la consulta","guid":"ROzcs9T3QRycRalOi9LaSw","children":[]},{"id":"222","parent":"216","text":"6. Analice la interacción entre los distintos pilares de la Medicina del Estilo de Vida en personas mayores y explique cómo la modificación de un pilar puede influir positivamente en los demás","guid":"HHnksQUUR_m2H9ovGWdELA","children":[]},{"id":"223","parent":"216","text":"7. En un paciente mayor con polifarmacia y riesgo de caídas, ¿cómo podría integrar intervenciones de estilo de vida para reducir riesgo, mejorar funcionalidad y eventualmente disminuir carga farmacológica?","guid":"ur1vKvH2SoWBcZ9vkk3_-g","children":[]}]},{"id":"224","parent":"0","text":"Evidencia complementaria\\N(papers oficiales)","guid":"DH781ZmfQiukrtNc5AD7pQ","children":[{"id":"225","parent":"224","text":"EWGSOP2 (Cruz-Jentoft 2019) → definición operativa sarcopenia: SARC-F → fuerza prensil → masa muscular → performance física","guid":"0ewzYKVRT6yKsyB8jvQJHA","children":[]},{"id":"226","parent":"224","text":"ICFSR sarcopenia 2018 (Dent) → entrenamiento de resistencia + proteína 1,0-1,2 g/kg/día como pilares de manejo","guid":"dhaekc6_QLqYZkQdUfjs2g","children":[]},{"id":"227","parent":"224","text":"PREDIMED (Estruch NEJM 2018) → dieta mediterránea + AOVE/frutos secos reduce ECV mayor 30% en alto riesgo CV","guid":"GZSOPQQJQ4-faoJT5A7Ocw","children":[]},{"id":"228","parent":"224","text":"Saint-Maurice JAMA 2020 → mortalidad cae al subir pasos diarios, sin asociación con intensidad (la cantidad mata, no el ritmo)","guid":"dYjCNL_7S6KoykZKSQvuGQ","children":[]},{"id":"229","parent":"224","text":"Holt-Lunstad 2015 → soledad/aislamiento OR mortalidad 1,26 a 1,32","guid":"iGKPcKUoQ6mWf7iGsg5Wag","children":[]},{"id":"230","parent":"224","text":"Candow Nutrients 2023 → creatina segura en mayores, mejora fuerza y función con entrenamiento","guid":"VXfHGum6RoKyBqJDXwh2Rw","children":[]},{"id":"231","parent":"224","text":"Lianov AJLM 2022 → competencias del médico para prescribir MEV","guid":"RWs-wakLQwmeRcGN0cHT2w","children":[]},{"id":"232","parent":"224","text":"OMS 2020 → 150-300 min/sem aeróbico moderado + ≥2 sesiones de fuerza","guid":"GDtCZF1AQNSUpQfOjnTeVg","children":[]},{"id":"233","parent":"224","text":"AGS Beers 2023 → PIMs en mayores; herramienta central para Pilar 6","guid":"BLqp6dnoSJSwP4UxN1E1KA","children":[]}]},{"id":"234","parent":"0","text":"Perlas\\NClínicas","guid":"C_Qf5vlCS8iiqVdW0jfYQw","children":[{"id":"235","parent":"234","text":"Perla 1: 80% de ECNT ligadas a estilo de vida → MEV es primera línea, no opcional","guid":"ik5tZCThTuC2VsX_2F8opA","children":[]},{"id":"236","parent":"234","text":"Perla 2: \"Nunca es muy temprano ni muy tarde\" → frase para usar literalmente con pacientes ≥90a","guid":"y8LD6SlaTpu4hznDNiyuPg","children":[]},{"id":"237","parent":"234","text":"Perla 3: Proteína 1,2-1,6 g/kg/día fragmentada en 25-30 g por comida → sin esta dosis el ejercicio no rinde","guid":"alIOjSWUTr2FcUw7CuCz_g","children":[]},{"id":"238","parent":"234","text":"Perla 4: El músculo es órgano endocrino + reserva cognitiva → argumento neuroprotector útil al motivar","guid":"ivwbTUncT1WZQb1BKOFMsw","children":[]},{"id":"239","parent":"234","text":"Perla 5: Ejercicio de FUERZA ≥2 ×/sem con descanso 1-2 días → más importante que cardio en mayoría AM","guid":"Aiz96isETlK3Or0oKp20QQ","children":[]},{"id":"240","parent":"234","text":"Perla 6: Borg en consulta → \"¿podía hablar?\" 5=moderado / 7=vigoroso (sin pulsómetro)","guid":"83GSSqZWRNmmd4AJp6s3-Q","children":[]},{"id":"241","parent":"234","text":"Perla 7: Soledad mata como tabaco → preguntar \"¿a quién acudiría si tiene una urgencia?\"","guid":"qWBue51ATiOPxjfCpK6rmQ","children":[]},{"id":"242","parent":"234","text":"Perla 8: Insomnio en mayor NO es normal → marcador de patología crónica subyacente","guid":"aU7WBVrsQuavjo0OJBirhg","children":[]},{"id":"243","parent":"234","text":"Perla 9: Creatina segura aún en falla renal → no progresa daño, sólo altera medición creatinina","guid":"k7aI3zHxRW-clwR4bApNqw","children":[]},{"id":"244","parent":"234","text":"Perla 10: Coach + SMART + confianza ≥70% → simplificar hasta lograr umbral; objetivo modesto cumplido > ambicioso fallido","guid":"-tC1zBZzRI2yD4O1GRvSIQ","children":[]},{"id":"245","parent":"234","text":"Perla 11: Saint-Maurice 2020 → la CANTIDAD de pasos importa, NO la intensidad → caminar despacio también cuenta","guid":"mS6SPKbwQByYO2H679P7Mw","children":[]}]},{"id":"246","parent":"0","text":"Conceptos examinados\\N(Evaluaciones SGGCh 2026)","guid":"hhjRnXZgRmakW9ce1PtzDA","children":[{"id":"247","parent":"246","text":"Evaluacion M2\\N(refuerzo cruzado de\\NPilar Nutricion +\\NEjercicio)","guid":"7CZuACxaTnSkUOI9GZLD1A","children":[{"id":"248","parent":"247","text":"P2 (proteinas AM sanos): rango 1,2-1,6 g/kg/dia es el aplicado en Pilar 1 nutricion -> superior al 0,8 g/kg del adulto joven por resistencia anabolica","guid":"9_I_jXNWS32ml5q65CoY4A","children":[]},{"id":"249","parent":"247","text":"P11 (proteinas en fragil): 1,2-1,5 g/kg/dia consenso PROT-AGE/ESPEN; encaja con Pilar 1 reforzando que sin esta dosis el ejercicio no rinde","guid":"yPfQb8E5TlO5h0RELqLF-w","children":[]},{"id":"250","parent":"247","text":"P14 (ejercicio mayor impacto AVD): entrenamiento de FUERZA progresivo -> coincide con enfasis del docente \"fuerza fundamental, mas importante que cardio en AM\"","guid":"5zrZFUr2TmudwJgIaCtc9Q","children":[]}]},{"id":"251","parent":"246","text":"Evaluacion Final\\N(transversales)","guid":"jId8QTbdQpOmVPbks6B9aw","children":[{"id":"252","parent":"251","text":"P9 (intervencion mayor evidencia fragilidad): ejercicio multicomponente -> reafirma que el Pilar 2 debe prescribirse como multicomponente, no solo aerobico","guid":"WL_c2aSvRpOhsiIOU60Hiw","children":[]},{"id":"253","parent":"251","text":"Concepto MEV: Pilar 1 + Pilar 2 son los mas examinados; la prescripcion de fuerza + proteina fragmentada es el take-home del modulo","guid":"4WpLp6veQjGHkxq8VzPSOQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"254","parent":"0","text":"Referencias (bibliografía oficial\\NDr. Juan Carlos Rodríguez)","guid":"pvT6_1gdR0SbixvtEcJmIQ","children":[{"id":"255","parent":"254","text":"1. AGS Beers Criteria Update 2023. J Am Geriatr Soc. 2023;71(7):2052-2081. doi:10.1111/jgs.18372","guid":"ClPqaC3cQnyKcEw_ui4BmQ","children":[]},{"id":"256","parent":"254","text":"2. Cruz-Jentoft AJ, et al. Sarcopenia: Revised European consensus (EWGSOP2). Age Ageing. 2019;48(4):601-617. doi:10.1093/ageing/afz046","guid":"-11inMZ5QAmQWAO1RIML0Q","children":[]},{"id":"257","parent":"254","text":"3. Dent E, et al. International clinical practice guidelines for sarcopenia (ICFSR). J Nutr Health Aging. 2018;22(10):1148-1161. doi:10.1007/s12603-018-1139-9","guid":"FmKSDcG6QiKsf-j6nqC-Nw","children":[]},{"id":"258","parent":"254","text":"4. Estruch R, et al. Primary prevention of cardiovascular disease with a Mediterranean diet (PREDIMED). N Engl J Med. 2018;378(25):e34. doi:10.1056/NEJMoa1800389","guid":"Cl84QXzoSeqSv--mRh6wfw","children":[]},{"id":"259","parent":"254","text":"5. Holt-Lunstad J, et al. Loneliness and social isolation as risk factors for mortality. Perspect Psychol Sci. 2015;10(2):227-237. doi:10.1177/1745691614568352","guid":"AvbDFdflR9yTL9-PeQwBLQ","children":[]},{"id":"260","parent":"254","text":"6. Saint-Maurice PF, et al. Association of daily step count and step intensity with mortality among US adults. JAMA. 2020;323(12):1151-1160. doi:10.1001/jama.2020.1382","guid":"jkU2-RQySpinpRGg5b3lgw","children":[]},{"id":"261","parent":"254","text":"7. Candow DG, et al. Creatine supplementation in older adults. Nutrients. 2023;15(3):558. doi:10.3390/nu15030558","guid":"hLy1__GdRUSzUm84yi2UMQ","children":[]},{"id":"262","parent":"254","text":"8. Lianov L, Johnson M. Physician competencies for prescribing lifestyle medicine. Am J Lifestyle Med. 2022;16(2):130-138. doi:10.1177/15598276211036710","guid":"5hQSFZ05QJW9uaYeSp9h0g","children":[]},{"id":"263","parent":"254","text":"9. WHO guidelines on physical activity and sedentary behaviour. World Health Organization; 2020","guid":"VV0WRSVlQOif6P2IsAqK7g","children":[]}]}]},"node_count":263,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Hematología","folder":"Entidades clínicas/Hematología","filename":"Williams. Anemias sideroblásticas hereditarias y adquiridas-2025","id":"map_166","resolved_references":[]}